<style is:inline>
:root{--ink:#222;--grey:#666;--line:#e3e3e3;--soft:#f4f2ef;--red:#b5121b;--dark:#1d1d1d}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;line-height:1.6;font-size:17px}
.sans,header,.btn,.facts,footer,.mbar{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5}
header .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;height:62px;gap:12px}
.logo{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:15px;text-decoration:none}
.logo span{color:var(--red)}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--red);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap}
.btn.line{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1px solid #fff}
.hero{position:relative;color:#fff;min-height:520px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--dark)}
.hero picture,.hero img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.72),rgba(0,0,0,.25))}
.hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;width:100%;padding-top:70px;padding-bottom:70px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,52px);font-weight:400;line-height:1.12;max-width:13em}
.hero p{font-size:19px;max-width:30em;margin:16px 0 26px;color:#eee}
.hero .ctas{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.facts{background:var(--soft)}
.facts .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;padding-top:26px;padding-bottom:26px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:var(--grey)}
.facts b{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-size:18px}
section{padding:64px 0}
h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,34px);font-weight:400;margin-bottom:18px}
.lead{max-width:40em;color:var(--grey);margin-bottom:30px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0 36px}
.grid div{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 0}
.grid h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:4px}
.grid p{color:var(--grey);font-size:15px}
.dark{background:var(--dark);color:#fff}
.dark .lead{color:#bbb}
.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px}
ol.steps{list-style:none;counter-reset:s}
ol.steps li{counter-increment:s;padding:14px 0 14px 52px;position:relative;border-top:1px solid #333}
ol.steps li::before{content:counter(s);position:absolute;left:0;top:12px;width:34px;height:34px;border:1px solid #fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px}
.call{text-align:center}
.call a.big{display:block;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,52px);text-decoration:none;margin:6px 0 18px}
.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--grey);margin-top:22px}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:26px 0 90px;font-size:13px;color:var(--grey)}
.mbar{display:none}
@media (max-width:820px){
 .grid,.two,.facts .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .hero{min-height:460px}
 header .btn{padding:9px 12px;font-size:14px}
 .mbar{display:block;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:6}
 .mbar a{display:block;text-align:center;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:16px;text-decoration:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="wrap">
 <a class="logo" href="/">Wolf <span>Stove</span> Repair</a>
 <a class="btn" href={`tel:${TEL}`}>Call {PHONE}</a>
</div></header>

<div class="hero">
 <picture>
  <source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/wolf-range-repair-800.webp 800w, /images/wolf-range-repair-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="100vw">
  <img src="/images/wolf-range-repair-1600.webp" width="1600" height="900" alt="Technician repairing a professional stainless steel range in a home kitchen" fetchpriority="high">
 </picture>
 <div class="wrap">
  <h1>Wolf range, oven and cooktop repair</h1>
  <p>We fix Wolf ranges, wall ovens, rangetops, cooktops, microwaves and hoods in your kitchen, across Los Angeles, Orange and Ventura counties.</p>
  <div class="ctas sans"><a class="btn" href={`tel:${TEL}`}>Call {PHONE}</a><a class="btn line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
 </div>
</div>

<div class="facts"><div class="wrap">
 <div><b>Gas, dual-fuel and induction</b>all Wolf cooking lines</div>
 <div><b>Monday to Saturday</b>technicians out 8 AM to 6 PM</div>
 <div><b>Price agreed first</b>no work before you say yes</div>
</div></div>

<section><div class="wrap">
 <h2>What we repair</h2>
 <p class="lead">Every Wolf cooking appliance still in service, from older dual-fuel ranges to current induction and steam models.</p>
 <div class="grid">
  <div><h3>Ranges</h3><p>Gas and dual-fuel ranges: burners, igniters, oven elements, convection fans, temperature control.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Wall ovens</h3><p>E Series and M Series ovens that will not heat, run hot, show error codes or have door and lock problems.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Rangetops and cooktops</h3><p>Gas, electric and induction: burners that click and will not light, low flame, dead induction zones.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Steam and speed ovens</h3><p>Convection steam ovens and speed ovens: water, steam, heating and control faults.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Microwaves and drawers</h3><p>Microwave drawers, built-in microwaves and warming drawers.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Ventilation hoods</h3><p>Fans, lights and controls on wall, island and insert hoods.</p></div>
 </div>
</div></section>

<section style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
 <h2>Common problems we see</h2>
 <div class="grid">
  <div><h3>Burner clicks, will not light</h3><p>Igniters, spark modules, wet or dirty burner heads.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Oven will not heat</h3><p>Bake and broil elements, gas igniters, safety valves, sensors.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Temperature is off</h3><p>Temperature sensors and controls; the oven runs too hot or too cold.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Error code on the display</h3><p>Control boards, sensors and wiring behind the fault code.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Convection fan noise</h3><p>Worn fan motors and bearings.</p></div>
  <div><h3>Door will not close or lock</h3><p>Hinges, gaskets, latches and door locks.</p></div>
 </div>
</div></section>

<section class="dark" id="how"><div class="wrap two">
 <div><h2>How a repair works</h2><p class="lead">One call, one technician at your door, one price agreed before any work.</p></div>
 <ol class="steps">
  <li>Call us with the model and what the appliance is doing.</li>
  <li>We schedule a visit, often the same or next day.</li>
  <li>The technician finds the cause and quotes one price.</li>
  <li>You approve, we repair and test before we leave.</li>
 </ol>
</div></section>

<section class="call"><div class="wrap">
 <h2>Wolf appliance not working?</h2>
 <p class="lead" style="margin:0 auto">Call and tell us the model and the problem.</p>
 <a class="big" href={`tel:${TEL}`}>{PHONE}</a>
 <a class="btn" href={`tel:${TEL}`}>Call now</a>
 <p class="note sans">Wolf Stove Repair is an independent repair service. We are not affiliated with Wolf or Sub-Zero Group, Inc. Wolf is a trademark of its owner, used here only to describe the appliances we repair.</p>
</div></section>

<footer><div class="wrap">Wolf Stove Repair · Los Angeles, Orange and Ventura counties · <a href={`tel:${TEL}`}>{PHONE}</a> · Monday to Saturday, 8 AM to 6 PM</div></footer>
<div class="mbar"><a href={`tel:${TEL}`}>Call {PHONE}</a></div>
